---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import headshot from '../images/headshot.jpg';
---

<Layout>
  <section class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
    <Image
      src={headshot}
      alt="Alastor Curns"
      width={576}
      height={576}
      class="h-56 w-56 rounded-full sm:h-72 sm:w-72"
    />
    <h1 class="mt-8 font-mono text-4xl font-semibold text-accent-soft sm:text-5xl">
      Alastor Curns
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-lg text-muted">
      Fullstack software developer with over 9 years in the field.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-lg text-muted">
      I got my C.S. degree in 2015, and have put it to good use ever since.
      I've primarily been developing application software for a complex and varied set of users that all have the goal of understanding what's happening on large and distributed networks.
      Beyond just seeing and understanding, there is also a desire to take action across the network seamlessly, and roll up crucial data to hubs.
      This is all while processing large volumes of data and keeping a clean data model. 
      Every deployment has it's own challenges for developers, which I tackle with enthusiasm.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
